<title>FINLAND: KYRO JAN-APRIL PROFIT RISES 79 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>KYRO JAN-APRIL PROFIT RISES 79 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April, 1997</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items			    50 vs 28</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.09 vs 0.60</p>
<p> Net sales					    251 vs 257</p>
<p> Operating profit				    10 vs 27</p>
<p> Depreciation					  13 vs 11</p>
<p> Net financial items			  gain 40 vs 1 gain</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			 charge 6 vs 2 charge</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	   44 vs 26</p>
<p> Taxes						   14 vs 8</p>
<p> Minorities				    charge 1 vs nil</p>
<p> Net profit					    29 vs 18</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)		51 vs 45</p>
<p> Return on equity (ROE) (percent)	     9.7 vs 19.4</p>
<p> Return on investment (ROI) (percent)	12.1 vs 15.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish machinery and power group is</p>
<p>Kyro Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
